    "topic": "Time and Work",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "question": "A can do in 10 days, B in 15 days. They start together, A leaves after 2 days. B finishes. Total days?",
    "options": [
        "10 days",
        "11 days",
        "12 days",
        "13 days"
    ],
    "answer": 2,
    "explanation": "2 days work = 2*(1/10+1/15) = 2*(5/30)=1/3. Left 2/3. B does 2/3 in (2/3)*15=10 days. Total=12."
}
